{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/986137-omen-ideas-for-current-characters","id":986137,"title":"Omen Ideas for Current Characters","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-10-12T07:57:14-07:00","id":986137,"title":"Omen Ideas for Current Characters","content":"Just as a fun little exercise. How about we come up with some Omens for characters we love:<br /> <br /> I think my Scion of Agni's skin would tint a little bit red.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12349-evilnerf","name":"evilnerf","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12349_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"56"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-12T08:49:14-07:00","id":986161,"title":"","content":"My Incarnate Scion of Azar/Osiris would definitely pick up a bull's head as she works on redefining herself as kind, loving feminine figure, as a nod not only to beautiful Hathor but to humble, sacrificial Apis.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-12T09:23:43-07:00","id":986177,"title":"","content":"Hmmm,y'know I always saw myself as someone who could be Chose by Hephaestus.<br /> At Legend 3 I'd have the scent of ashes about me<br /> At Legend 6 One of my arms would be metal<br /> At Legend 9 I'll have an aura of smoke and flames<br /> At Legend 12,i will always have burns marks on my limbs for I became the God of all forgers","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4621,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","user":"Nicolas Milioni","date":". 10-12-2016, 01:39 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-12T10:19:12-07:00","id":986207,"title":"","content":"Yes! i love this.<br /> <br /> Let's see...<br /> <br /> ok, a classic one<br /> <br /> Pantheon: Manitou<br /> Son of: The sky god<br /> <br /> Legend 3: changing Clouds colors (black turning in grey that turn in white) of the eyes instead of normal colors<br /> Legend 6: Eagle's Feathers growing on the head like Hairs (like a natural apache hat)<br /> Legend 9: Smell of rain and thunder noise in the air around the character<br /> legend 12: Stormy clouds follow the character","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12508-elanconnor","name":"ElanConnor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12508_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"172"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-12T11:55:06-07:00","id":986275,"title":"","content":"Yeesh, this is exciting.<br /> Eyes on palms for characters who are protectors/seers/judges<br /> Speech that is always poetic for characters who are creative/mysterious/tricky. Yes, limericks count, but only when appropriate.<br /> Weirdly colored hair that cannot be cut for characters centered around holiness, purity or beauty.<br /> Glowing sigils on tongue for the wise, charming or knowledgeable characters.<br /> The fertility, travel or asceticism oriented character is always barefoot, leaving unusual tracks that fit his/her character (plants growing, embers glowing, etc.)<br /> The warrior demigod's face is always covered in war paint appropriate to their culture.<br /> Or maybe their clothes always appear torn and weapons rusty.<br /> A sage might have sigils on their skin that decidedly do not look like tattoos if inspected closely.<br /> Demigods connected to animals might sometimes screech or howl or purr, whatever. Perfectly.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5530-xanthias","name":"Xanthias","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"53"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-12T14:26:08-07:00","id":986381,"title":"","content":"Good ideas!<br /> <br /> ok, another one<br /> <br /> Richard Ludgrin - Reincarnation of Volstagg, Hero of Asgard<br /> <br /> I know, this is silly, but i'd love play a Warrior like this<br /> <br /> Legend 3: Every Clothes richard wears became XL but he doesn't get fat, only the clothes. (richard weighs 65 Kg - 140 pounds)<br /> Legend 6: From a medium distance Richars looks drunk, even if he doesn't<br /> Legend 9: Anyone who is near to Richard has a slight feeling of hunger<br /> Legend 12: Food and Drinks came out of his pockets anytime he wants<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12508-elanconnor","name":"ElanConnor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12508_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"172"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-12T17:31:15-07:00","id":986488,"title":"","content":"Amanda Jane Smith, Farmgirl Scion of the Manitou<br /> <br /> Legend 3: AJ smells like freshly-tilled soil.<br /> Legend 6: As AJ passes, plants are more vibrant and healthy in her wake.<br /> Legend 9: When AJ's near fruit and plants, the fruits ripen if they were not so already.<br /> Legend 12: AJ has a Stenson hat that she considers her most valuable possession. Should she lose it, Fate will conspire to get it back in her hands. (The hat is not a relic. She just likes it)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-12T20:33:26-07:00","id":986546,"title":"","content":"The first thing that sprung to my mind is for Sophia Kallis, my Scion of Athena who is inspired by detectives shows and MacGyver, having the &quot;Policeman's Holiday&quot; curse that no matter where she goes and what she does, a mystery of some kind springs up that she gets involved with.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9296-zeldafan42","name":"Zeldafan42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9296_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"43"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-12T21:08:47-07:00","id":986567,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Zeldafan42</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/986137-omen-ideas-for-current-characters?p=986546#post986546\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The first thing that sprung to my mind is for Sophia Kallis, my Scion of Athena who is inspired by detectives shows and MacGyver, having the &quot;Policeman's Holiday&quot; curse that no matter where she goes and what she does, a mystery of some kind springs up that she gets involved with.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bI thought that was an effect of a Scion's Fateful Aura (at least in 1e)... that no matter where a Scion goes, Fate ensures that there is something that will involve the Scion... almost as if trouble seeks them out.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>There are three types of people in the world... those who can count and those who can't.<br /> I reject your reality and substitute my own!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2243-shadowstripe","name":"Shadowstripe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2243_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"344"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-13T03:04:45-07:00","id":986656,"title":"","content":"The mistery aura is a pretty cool idea, sounds like &quot; Murder, She Wrote Aura&quot; everywhere u'll go, someone will die","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12508-elanconnor","name":"ElanConnor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12508_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"172"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-13T05:10:05-07:00","id":986688,"title":"","content":"where were the rules on omens spoiled?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Call Me <b>Ray</b>.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://southern-gothic.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Southern Gothic </a>- Welcome to New Calais","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/256-gnomish-american","name":"Gnomish American","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar256_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"569"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-13T05:18:42-07:00","id":986691,"title":"","content":"Stephanie Jackson Scion of Poseidon:<br /> \u200bL3- Inky black eyes<br /> \u200bL6- Always appears water-logged<br /> \u200bL9- rubbery mottled skin<br /> L12 - Legs replaced by tentacles, webbed fingers<br /> <br /> \u200b(Stefana Gurga - Goddess of the black depths)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Call Me <b>Ray</b>.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://southern-gothic.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Southern Gothic </a>- Welcome to New Calais","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/256-gnomish-american","name":"Gnomish American","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar256_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"569"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-13T06:53:34-07:00","id":986731,"title":"","content":"Son of Vayu, god of the wind - Yazata<br /> <br /> Legend 3: It seems he's not breathing<br /> Legend 6: He walks 2 inches above the ground<br /> Legend 9: Everytime he spokes, the words flies way far than normal <br /> Legend 12: His legs are surrounded by a strong little tornado (like this <a href=\"http://media.mmo-champion.com/images/news/2010/november/alakir.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">http://media.mmo-champion.com/images...ber/alakir.jpg</a>) <br /> <br /> Quote: Like Swatting Insects!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12508-elanconnor","name":"ElanConnor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12508_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"172"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-13T08:58:33-07:00","id":986789,"title":"","content":"Vasilias Tis L\u00edthtargo, Son of Nyx and Greek god of Sloth and Flies.<br /> <br /> Legend 3: The smell of rot always seem to cling to his clothes and tools<br /> Legend 6: his eyes are compound like a fly<br /> Legend 9: everything aroudn him seens slightly slower,metal rust food rots,even men's sous start to slow down<br /> Legend 12: A crown of buzzing fat flies always surround his head<br /> <br /> Vasilias was the first member of the Theoi to steal the mantle of another deity in Millenia. He was once only the god of flies and rot,the base matter all men are made of,and due to his morbid fascination with the sin of sloth Vasilias cooked up a scheme. He managed to convince Hypnos God of Dreams that the Titans were <i>all </i>already out of tartarus and had decided to throw hypnos back there. The old god was already going go believe Vasilias Lies but just to be sure he Conjured a illusion of Typhoeus, Titan of Beasts. In his horror hyppnos tried to cast the most powerful of his Boons to send Typhoeues to Eternal Sleep,when he did so the illusion was shattered revealing a speacially prepared mirror meant to send Hypnoss power back to him. By making the God of Sleep slumber forever,Vasilias Tis L\u00edthargo become one of the most distubring members of his pantheon","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-13T09:32:51-07:00","id":986806,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gnomish American</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/986137-omen-ideas-for-current-characters?p=986688#post986688\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">where were the rules on omens spoiled?</div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/985876-q-a-with-neall-transcript?p=986187#post986187\">His RPGnet Q&amp;A on IRC</a>.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> [20:02] &lt;+Keftiu&gt; How do Netjer animal heads work? (Asking about Omens, essentially.)<br /> [20:03] &lt;+Neall&gt; Keftiu: when you hit Legend 3, and every third Legend after, you get an Omen that sort of\u2026sits on you. It\u2019s an expression of your divine nature. Could be the lack of an eye. Could be an animal head.<br /> [20:04] &lt;+Neall&gt; It\u2019s largely cosmetic, but it does have some effects when you\u2019re searching for a character or working motifs.<br /> [20:04] &lt;+JamesGillen&gt; Could be theme music?<br /> [20:04] &lt;+Neall&gt; JamesGillen: Absolutely!<br /> [20:04] &lt;+Neall&gt; A choir singing, etc.<br /> [20:05] &lt;+IanW&gt; Yakkety Sax </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-14T07:33:58-07:00","id":987249,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shadowstripe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/986137-omen-ideas-for-current-characters?p=986567#post986567\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> \u200bI thought that was an effect of a Scion's Fateful Aura (at least in 1e)... that no matter where a Scion goes, Fate ensures that there is something that will involve the Scion... almost as if trouble seeks them out.</div> </div> </div> </div>The idea is that with this character, Fate is basically making their lives more like a detective novel/show. It's not just that she always gets drawn into trouble, it's that she always finds a mystery. If she travels somewhere and there isn't already a crime she's trying to investigate, then Fate conspires to have her stumble into one.<br /> <br /> It's like when you're watching an episode of Psych, and the episode starts with Sean traveling somewhere on vacation to get away from solving cases. You know that there will be a mystery to solve at his destination.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9296-zeldafan42","name":"Zeldafan42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9296_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"43"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-14T10:06:51-07:00","id":987320,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Zeldafan42</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/986137-omen-ideas-for-current-characters?p=987249#post987249\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The idea is that with this character, Fate is basically making their lives more like a detective novel/show. It's not just that she always gets drawn into trouble, it's that she always finds a mystery. If she travels somewhere and there isn't already a crime she's trying to investigate, then Fate conspires to have her stumble into one.<br /> <br /> It's like when you're watching an episode of Psych, and the episode starts with Sean traveling somewhere on vacation to get away from solving cases. You know that there will be a mystery to solve at his destination.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bStill sounds like the effects of a Scion's Fateful Aura. Omens sound more like something that affects the Scion directly, such has some physical oddity or behavior (missing a body part, animal-like features, additional libs) and such, rather than affecting others. If the Scion is stumbling into mysteries wherever she goes, that would be Fate manipulating events to fit her legend (as a detective). Adopting clothing reminiscent of Sherlock Holmes however would be more like an Omen as it more directly affects her and fits her legend, making her look more like what some would perceive as a detective. Always having small tools to assist in an investigation without contaminating evidence (rubber gloves, zip-lock bags, even a pencil to move things or a small camera to document things) would be another Omen that would work (gives her the small tools she needs while giving her a small advantage in her efforts... just don't ask how she has them while in a bikini on a beach).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>There are three types of people in the world... those who can count and those who can't.<br /> I reject your reality and substitute my own!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2243-shadowstripe","name":"Shadowstripe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2243_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"344"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-14T11:23:57-07:00","id":987342,"title":"","content":"Possible Detective Omen: People hear some of her thoughts when she's in Detective Mode, as a soft Private Eye Monologue whispering just loud enough to be heard.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;You know, I went to Miami Beach to get some relaxation and some sun. Instead I'm dealing with a dead college student. Typical of my life. But it was a mystery, and I was always a sucker for those. Especially when a dame in a cute bikini asked me to figure out what happened to her friend.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> NPC: What?<br /> <br /> PC: That happens sometimes, just ignore it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":2142,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","user":"Kyman201","date":". 10-14-2016, 03:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-14T12:16:03-07:00","id":987372,"title":"","content":"Hamasaki Hayate, bancho/delinquent and scion of Susano'o - The tails of his headband constantly flutter as if being blown back by a breeze, even when the wind is still","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9296-zeldafan42","name":"Zeldafan42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9296_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"43"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-14T13:40:03-07:00","id":987414,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kyman201</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/986137-omen-ideas-for-current-characters?p=987342#post987342\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Possible Detective Omen: People hear some of her thoughts when she's in Detective Mode, as a soft Private Eye Monologue whispering just loud enough to be heard.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;You know, I went to Miami Beach to get some relaxation and some sun. Instead I'm dealing with a dead college student. Typical of my life. But it was a mystery, and I was always a sucker for those. Especially when a dame in a cute bikini asked me to figure out what happened to her friend.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> NPC: What?<br /> <br /> PC: That happens sometimes, just ignore it.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bSort of like the character is narrating a crime novel that those in the immediate vicinity sometimes here (especially when s/he is thinking of them)... that is an interesting Omen, something that colors the character's interaction with others to a small degree, doesn't offer a large advantage (small situational one at best), provides great role-play opportunities and doesn't affect the overall flow of the adventure (which was going to happen whether the Omen interacted with anyone or not).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>There are three types of people in the world... those who can count and those who can't.<br /> I reject your reality and substitute my own!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2243-shadowstripe","name":"Shadowstripe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2243_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"344"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}